# Real data — NEVER commit. The script is the artifact; the data is not.
# Anything under data/real/ or raw/ is derived from a real inbox (sender names,
# addresses, subject lines) or is a per-item API response that echoes it.
# Only code, synthetic fixtures, and aggregate RESULTS.md numbers are publishable.
**/data/real/
**/raw/
*.csv
*.jsonl
*.tsv

# Except synthetic fixtures, which contain no real data, and public datasets
# built from openly licensed sources (each carries its own licence note).
!**/data/fixtures/**/*.jsonl
!**/data/fixtures/**/*.csv
!**/data/public/**/*.jsonl

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local scratch
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
